  "description": "26\" Dual Springer Cruiser EBike with 500W Motor\nRide in style with this 26\" dual springer stretch cruiser ebike. Featuring a powerful 500W motor, 48V battery, and 3 assist modes, it offers smooth rides, a vintage leather saddle, and a range of up to 50 miles. Perfect for cruising or commuting!\n\nCOLORS\nBlack/Black, Blue/Black, Green, Matte Black, Green, Red\n\nFRAME\nTracer Stretch Chopper Hi-ten Steel Include Plastic battery tank cover.\n\nFORK\nTracer FK-DS26218135D8 Classic Dual Springer Disc Brake\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\nMBX Adjustable Speed Sensor Cartridge Steel 100x159.5mm\n\nRIMS\nAlloy FAT Front 26\"x3\"x36H Rear 26\"x3\" x36H\n\nREAR HUB MOTOR\nEquipped with 48V 500W light weight high speed brushless.\n\nMAX SPEED\n25 Mph (Hanging speed,Actual conditions will vary based on rider weight, terrain and slope)\n\nLIGHTS\nFront and Rear LED with brake function.\n\nEXTRAS\nThis Lithium Battery 26 Inch Electric Stretch Chopper Bike is powered by 48V/17.5Ah Li-ion battery which can be charged in 4-6 hours. It is constructed with Alloy/Hi-ten steel. Equipped with 500W light weight high speed brushless rear wheel hub motor (EU), it can achieve a maximum speed of 25mile/h with a travel range of 30-50mile. It has an intelligent Pedals Assisted System 3 riding modes and 5 levels of pedal assist, which makes it like a normal bike and provides a natural riding experience, right at your fingertips. Toggle between three levels of assist with easy-to-use on-bar controls. will be a better choice for long time travel and exercise.",
